  "body": "This is a start with marking up the two most explicit arguments to the navigate algorithm. It doesn’t address any of the problems per se, such as that it’s unclear what “resource” is here and such.\n\nIt also doesn’t tackle the various algorithms navigate hooks into.\n\nIt’s not entirely clear to me how to best approach this. This algorithm is dearly in need of some serious work and I figured that maybe by taking small steps we can make it better over time, but maybe there’s a better approach?\n",
